<title>POLAND: Elektrobudowa Q2 net falls to PLN 7 mln.</title>
<headline>Elektrobudowa Q2 net falls to PLN 7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elektrobudowa preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			6.99 vs     9.12</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  6.80  vs    8.77</p>
<p>    net profit				4.48  vs    4.61</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Elektrobudowa SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				64.25  vs   60.65</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 54.87  vs   47.72</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		    0.00  vs    0.03</p>
<p>    income tax				2.20  vs    4.16</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    0.44  vs    0.60</p>
<p>    financial costs			 0.63  vs    0.92</p>
<p>    investment				2.84  vs    1.31</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     12.94  vs   14.59</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 12.54  vs   13.71</p>
<p>    net profit				8.34  vs    7.87</p>
<p>    net sales			     116.98  vs  106.78</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 99.83  vs   86.66</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		    0.00  vs    0.02</p>
<p>    income tax				4.20  vs    5.83</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    0.73  vs    0.71</p>
<p>    financial costs			 1.13  vs    1.57</p>
<p>    investment				6.18  vs    2.62</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
